{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/pulls/198","id":4258211091,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTU9MBc79zyUT","html_url":"https://github.com/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/pull/198","diff_url":"https://github.com/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/pull/198.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/pull/198.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/issues/198","number":198,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(stage3b): isolate C1 train-only dataset access","user":{"login":"attractor-set","id":5798304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTgzMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5798304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set","html_url":"https://github.com/attractor-set","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attractor-set/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Authors the minimal project-owned train-only dataset-isolation\ncorrection required before C1 request freeze can resume.\n\nBase:\n`2d748751482a6b3ecb200fb3816d41f48d8ed8cc` / `f6ce596c2d7ff45a054ed8c0bb5d6ceb3cc3b97d`\n\nAdmission audit:\n`sha256:119113ab83b2622ab0e005bc16318bf88fc4e41ced56ad183c10813d5e63f784`\n\nCurrent frozen image is preserved unchanged:\n`sha256:7aefbc241ad725f4ac31d8b72c63a82247516ad4831aad6f7d0ef89817f9dacb`\n\nCurrent freeze:\n`sha256:47c20698ac57c1b50f4bbe0314649b0d07494ecc1199b32819ecde7b684d9904`\n\nProspective corrected runtime manifest:\n`sha256:01d86f045bf42554382654d2c48f2be23f4763b6fbdc4aa1c9e7cff939367561`\n\nThe correction:\n- restricts live scientific requests to exactly the uncompressed train-image and\n  train-label IDX pair;\n- rejects t10k/test resources at request-schema construction;\n- removes the torchvision Dataset constructor from scientific runtime;\n- parses only the two bound train IDX files;\n- preserves the existing 28x28 -> 1x32x32 zero-pad/scale transform;\n- includes an adversarial t10k open trap and malformed-IDX fail-closed tests.\n\nThis PR does NOT build/run/pull/tag/commit a Docker image, mutate the current\nfrozen image/evidence, freeze C1, consume the prior C1 request-freeze\nauthorization, issue C1 execution authorization, execute science, access test\ndata, or permit publication.\n\nAfter merge: independently verify canonical main, then use a separate\nauthorization to build/validate/freeze the corrected scientific image.\n\n\nAuthoring recovery note:\nthe initial authorized materialization passed its 18 targeted tests but stopped\nbefore the Git authoring boundary on Ruff I001 in the newly added test import\nblock. The preserved dirty state was recovered with a three-path deterministic\ndelta: import ordering plus the two dependent evidence hashes. Scientific\nruntime source and the 157-path prospective runtime manifest are unchanged.\n","created_at":"2026-08-12T01:06:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T01:16:21Z","closed_at":"2026-08-12T01:16:17Z","merged_at":"2026-08-12T01:16:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"3858d3a7e6d7b3401e999523bc6675dc7dd0223d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/pulls/198/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/attr